{"data": [{"author_id": "961132338", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:26:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115510612902150305"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Cd5SMdBb7o", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/M_C_Klein/status/2115510612902150305/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115510484615266304", "start": 0, "url": "https://t.co/Cd5SMdBb7o"}]}, "id": "2115510612902150305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1609, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/Cd5SMdBb7o", "url": "https://x.com/M_C_Klein/status/2115510612902150305"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:25:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115510395238801527"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 80, "id": "15935591", "start": 71, "username": "CMEGroup"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VijhCzt8i9", "end": 118, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115510395238801527/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115510390725414912", "start": 95, "url": "https://t.co/VijhCzt8i9"}]}, "id": "2115510395238801527", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 8904, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Odds of a second rate hike at next month’s Fed meeting now at 86%, per @CMEGroup FedWatch Tool https://t.co/VijhCzt8i9", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115510395238801527"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:18:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115508532086968511"], "id": "2115508532086968511", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 28276, "like_count": 131, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "With Cook dissenting, four different voters have voted to hike rates against the majority between this meeting and July.\n\nThe Fed hiked rates in September. The vote was 12-0 to hike rates.\n\nTells you their direction of travel.", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2115508532086968511"}, {"author_id": "961132338", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:06:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115505611245040124"], "id": "2115505611245040124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2785, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "\"Economic activity is expanding at a strong pace...inflation remains elevated\" and the policy move is...thoughts and prayers", "url": "https://x.com/M_C_Klein/status/2115505611245040124"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:06:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115505522816283048"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/As4Alzexmm", "end": 103, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115505522816283048/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115505520157052929", "start": 80, "url": "https://t.co/As4Alzexmm"}]}, "id": "2115505522816283048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 12621, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "No hike, but 2 dissents … here are the statement changes relative to last month https://t.co/As4Alzexmm", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115505522816283048"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:03:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115504739635036622"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dY4OsqWXQf", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115504739635036622/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115504650921332736", "start": 199, "url": "https://t.co/dY4OsqWXQf"}]}, "id": "2115504739635036622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3110, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Others are better suited to analyze other parts of the FOMC statement, but here's the econ part which upgraded the state of the economy, didn't touch labor market, and signaled patience on inflation https://t.co/dY4OsqWXQf", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115504739635036622"}, {"author_id": "961132338", "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:02:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115504593337807003"], "id": "2115504593337807003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2604, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Obviously plenty of good reasons to dissent in favor of raising rates, but hard not to think that Lisa Cook may have been motivated in part by the relentless unjustified legal threats", "url": "https://x.com/M_C_Klein/status/2115504593337807003"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-28T17:53:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115502195512848561"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/adam_tooze/sta…", "end": 38, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/adam_tooze/status/2115497770610000241", "start": 15, "url": "https://t.co/lf1NlqOuur"}]}, "id": "2115502195512848561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 6735, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115497770610000241", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Good questions https://t.co/lf1NlqOuur", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2115502195512848561"}, {"author_id": "3311286493", "created_at": "2026-10-28T17:35:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115497770610000241"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TBaRkO969F", "end": 149, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/adam_tooze/status/2115497770610000241/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115497587067191298", "start": 126, "url": "https://t.co/TBaRkO969F"}]}, "id": "2115497770610000241", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 12510, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "How stable is the dollar in an age of “speedball capitalism”?\nWhen the AI trade unravels, does the \"profit dolla\" go with it