onBerger/status/2115493386379727178"}, {"author_id": "961132338", "created_at": "2026-10-28T17:00:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115488944712507628"], "id": "2115488944712507628", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2348, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Foolish me, I initially thought that the Mbappe fracas was because people were upset that his meme trivialized Mao's violence and terror", "url": "https://x.com/M_C_Klein/status/2115488944712507628"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-28T16:52:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115486975134449962"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/fV12e0hdcb", "end": 246, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115486975134449962/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115486828296036352", "start": 223, "url": "https://t.co/fV12e0hdcb"}]}, "id": "2115486975134449962", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 149, "impression_count": 39322, "like_count": 316, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "Indeed job postings:\n\n1/ Software development postings are rocketing upward: Y/Y growth of almost 25%.  At that pace we're about a year away from pre-COVID levels (we're recovering from a deep depression in this category). https://t.co/fV12e0hdcb", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115486975134449962"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:14:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115462286118646203"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/whyyoutouzhele…", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115448501790285845", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/Gm8cEMNRHZ"}]}, "id": "2115462286118646203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4007, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115448501790285845", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "And the 划清界限 phase “On October 27, the Mbappé controversy spilled over to table tennis Olympic champion Fan Zhendong. Weibo blogger \"Xu Ji Observation\" posted an article demanding that he \"take a firm stand and cut ties swiftly,\" stating that \"this kind of idol is utterly https://t.co/Gm8cEMNRHZ", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2115462286118646203"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:13:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115461910720065650"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/NqtMKdKQw6", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115461910720065650/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115461198221107200", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/NqtMKdKQw6"}, {"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 320, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2115458240834162948", "start": 297, "url": "https://t.co/kjG3MLseUX"}]}, "id": "2115461910720065650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 33971, "like_count": 189, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115458240834162948", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Unfortunately, I can't really blame the writer for saying this. My son and I had to move seats to avoid a scuffle between two people who were on the same side! Civic engagement gives you a rush. I get it. But I'm not so sure these meetings really make for great democracy. https://t.co/NqtMKdKQw6 https://t.co/kjG3MLseUX", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115461910720065650"}, {"author_id": "3039504459", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:03:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115459368850247985"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Researchers have proposed that structural disorder can be harnessed to generate coherent, directional light from the passage of a charged particle.", "display_url": "go.aps.org/3W8bnvD", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://go.aps.org/3W8bnvD", "images": [{"height": 200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115459374307069952/e2yHhU63?format=png&name=orig", "width": 200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115459374307069952/e2yHhU63?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 244, "status": 200, "title": "Brewster-Anomaly Delocalization for Free-Electron Radiation", "unwound_url": "https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/fkp4-9l19", "url": "https://t.co/dUNuQsY7zY"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/akPai83Zbj", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2115459368850247985/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115459366174265344", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/akPai83Zbj"}]}, "id": "2115459368850247985", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 1060, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Scientists leverage the Brewster anomaly to bypass the limitations of Anderson localization and enable intensely directional free-electron radiation — a theoretical finding that could enable simple and scalable radiative platforms.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/dUNuQsY7zY https://t.co/akPai83Zbj", "url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2115459368850247985"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:58:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115458240834162948"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Plus, more news for your humpday.", "display_url": "hellgatenyc.com/cb3-tompkins-c…", "end": 77, "expanded_url": "https://hellgatenyc.com/cb3-tompkins-calisthenics-gym/", "images": [{"height": 900, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115446097967562752/PmnqUUQO?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115446097967562752/PmnqUUQO?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 54, "status": 200, "title": "East Village Pull-Up Bar Preservationists Test the Limits of Democracy", "unwound_url": "https://hellgatenyc.com/cb3-tompkins-calisthenics-gym/", "url": "https://t.co/AYiHT7lNXy"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/